  "APIProfile":       "Basic",
  "Description":      "Scene and Avatar Rendering: places the Speaking Avatar in a Scene seen and heard from a Point of View and produces the Scene as data. This Implementation produces the 3D alternative: the 3D Model Scene with the Avatar placed - for a 3D Model Object Delivery to draw - and the Multimodal Scene of the Audio Scene, the Speech Scene (the Avatar's speech at its mouth) and the 3D Model Scene. It takes Basic Audio and Basic 3D Models; the Audio, the 3D Model and the Point of View are kept until replaced.",

